# Fault W-D-F2: a binding over a kind checked every `fulfils` link by evaluating the fulfilled instance's amounts, so a
# plan whose amount reads that binding (pb reads got, a sum over ka) got RUN-CYCLE at its booking cut, then
# ENGINE-INVARIANT. L §5.19 A link is judged by existence: "A link reads only what it names: the existence of the
# instance, by its keys and `where`, never its amounts." got[2026-02] counts the one ka movement of February, pa's
# 1.00 PLN (q). (The fault's text stated `outside PLN`; an outside place states no unit now (L §5.10), so it is
# dropped here.)
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source own "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind ka: transfers
input bank: observed
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
move pa[m in months]: ka
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
move pb[m in months]: transfers
  on end_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount got[m]
def got[m in months]: money PLN = sum(t.cash.amount for t in ka over m)
version v
  cite own
  known 2026-01-01
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-27, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 1.00 PLN, fulfils: pb[2026-02]) "x"
ask q: got[2026-02]
=== expect
q: 1.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pa[2026-02]
  cut 2026-10-20
